{"id": "ledger-l9-03", "model": "openai/gpt-5.6-sol", "provider": "openrouter", "model_answer": "The 200 returned class-7 postings are already in chronological order in the table above, with each posting’s amount and running cumulative revenue.\n\n- **First posting:** 2 Jan 2023, SI23-0001, **3,644.12**\n- **Cumulative at 31 Dec 2023:** **312,141.80**\n- **Cumulative at 30 Jun 2024:** **469,206.21**\n- **Latest shown:** 4 Jul 2024, SI24-0162, **2,784.64**, bringing cumulative revenue to **475,982.19**\n\nRevenue is not accumulating at a perfectly steady pace. Visible monthly slowdowns occur in **August 2023** (about **14,557.87**) and **January 2024** (about **19,024.64**). Acceleration is clearest in **November and December 2023** (about **35,698.31** and **34,506.04**) and **May 2024** (about **31,144.91**). Most other complete months add roughly **21,000–29,500**, indicating a generally consistent underlying pace with noticeable month-to-month variation.\n\nThe displayed result only covers **2 Jan 2023 through 4 Jul 2024** and is capped at 200 rows, so it does not support a full three-year assessment.", "duration_seconds": 16.67, "input_tokens": 5641, "output_tokens": 733, "cost_usd": null}
